      <h1>AZERTY Coach privacy</h1>
      <p class="hero-legal__definition hero-legal__definition--etat">AZERTY Coach has no account, no sign-in and no form: it collects no information about you.</p>
      <p class="hero-legal__definition">This page covers the connector only. The azerty.global website has its own <a href="/confidentialite">privacy policy</a>, in French.</p>
